  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="One queue item = one Belastningsregister row in Background Checks.&#xA;Pending: the candidate orders the extract, so the row only waits for the candidate's mail.&#xA;Waiting for answer: look for the extract mail, read the PDF and check it in the police control service.&#xA;&#xA;Bad data (business rule) sets the row to Needs review; the robot never sets Failed." DisplayName="Process" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
